  farm:"separate", farm_t:"Separate regulation. Art. 7(1)(d) leaves agricultural workers and private herders out of the Labor Law. Ministerial Decision 115919 (18 Feb 2025) covers farm, nursery and livestock workers employed by individuals (arts 1–2): 8-hour day with overtime at +50%, a paid weekly rest day, 30 days' leave per two years, monthly payment into a bank account, no passport retention, all recruitment and residence fees borne by the employer, and end-of-service pay. It has no rules on changing employer or on association. Workers of agricultural establishments fall outside the regulation; their position under the Labor Law is read from art. 7 and the regulation's scope. Home farmers are domestic workers under Ministerial Decision 40676/1445.",
  farm_t_id:"Peraturan tersendiri. Pasal 7(1)(d) mengecualikan buruh tani dan penggembala pribadi dari UU Ketenagakerjaan. Keputusan Menteri 115919 (18 Feb 2025) mengatur buruh tani, pembibitan dan peternakan yang dipekerjakan perorangan (pasal 1–2): 8 jam sehari dengan lembur +50%, satu hari istirahat mingguan berbayar, cuti 30 hari per dua tahun, upah bulanan ke rekening bank, larangan menahan paspor, semua biaya rekrutmen dan izin tinggal ditanggung majikan, serta pesangon. Peraturan ini tidak mengatur pindah majikan maupun berserikat. Pekerja usaha pertanian berada di luar peraturan ini; kedudukan mereka dalam UU Ketenagakerjaan dibaca dari pasal 7 dan ruang lingkup peraturan. Petani rumah tangga adalah pekerja rumah tangga menurut Keputusan Menteri 40676/1445.",
